    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.starter\n\n### Description\n\nRather than using <bs> to delete symbol from query, it would be great if that symbol would be automatically discarded. No need to <bs> == we save one click.\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/13521338/155856791-3ef20d70-f833-4625-9965-386a7279839e.png)\r\n",
